<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The prayer card, hand-built out of framework views — the SAME architecture
  the tasbih card proved on this launcher (see widget_tasbih_native.xml).

  Why this is not Glance any more
  ===============================
  Two device-measured facts, both on the POCO X7 Pro / HyperOS / Android 16:

  1. LATENCY. A tap on a prayer capsule went broadcast → prefs toggle → a FULL
     Glance recomposition. Measured 2026-11-04: the receiver committed in
     +37 ms but the composition reached `compose palette=…` at +444 ms — the
     card visibly changed half a second after the tap. And Glance cannot be
     patched into partial updates: its decompiled RemoteViewsTranslatorKt
     inserts any AndroidRemoteViews as a CHILD of a Glance-generated root
     (insertView), so the root layoutId is never ours and
     AppWidgetHostView.canRecycleView can never recycle the tree.

  2. BUDGET. The Glance card drew bands the budget never priced (a 34 dp
     countdown pill, a 6 dp spacer, the 20 dp icon holders, the header row,
     the card's own paddings), so the weighted capsule row absorbed the
     shortfall and on the default cell rendered ~39 dp for ~70 dp of content:
     only icons showed, names and times were sliced
     («اوقات نماز در حجم فعلی ظاهر نیستند»).

  A hand-written RemoteViews has no session to go stale and no composition to
  wait for: a tap is partiallyUpdateAppWidget with ONLY the capsule setters
  that changed (PrayerNativeViews.capsules), merged into the view the launcher
  already has. The full render happens on placement, resize, snapshot push and
  the boundary/minute/watchdog alarms.

  THE CAPSULE (2026-11-04 second brief)
  =====================================
  «باکس‌های اوقات تمامی گزینه‌های موجود نشان نمی‌دن منظورم تیک‌هاست … فقط نماز
  مغرب قابل تیک زدن هست … در سایز پیشفرض تیک‌ها مخفی هستند». The mark was
  being written for all five prayers (device-verified: prayer=0..4
  marked=true) but the only place it could SHOW was a 20 dp icon holder the
  budget dropped on the default cell. The holder is gone: each capsule is now
  a name row (an inline check + the name) over the time, the check is always
  drawn, and the 23 dp the holder used to cost went to the clock and to real
  air between the boxes («خیلی بهم چسبیدند … فاصله بزار بینشون»).

  WHY THE FILE IS NAMED _v2
  =========================
  A launcher recycles an inflated widget tree when the new RemoteViews has the
  SAME layout id, applying only the setters to the view it already has. After
  this file's structure changed (icon boxes out, name rows and checks in), the
  recycled tree no longer contained the new ids: the setters for them were
  dropped, the old card stayed on screen, and the render looked like a no-op
  (measured on the POCO, 2026-11-04 — identical view bounds before and after
  the install). Renaming the resource forces `AppWidgetHostView` to inflate a
  fresh tree. Any future change to this file's STRUCTURE must rename it again
  (or the card will silently keep the previous shape); changes to sizes and
  colours alone are safe.

  NO FIXED dp SIZES — every text size, padding, check bitmap and the pill
  bitmap are set by PrayerNativeViews from PrayerWidgetBudget + the cell the
  launcher granted, exactly the contract the tasbih card uses. The ids below
  are that contract: the _0.._4 capsule groups are bound by both the full and
  the tap render; everything else only by the full render.

  The countdown Chronometer is a DIRECT child (not a nested leaf): the
  dedicated setChronometer/setChronometerCountDown setters re-base it on every
  full render, and it ticks inside the launcher between renders.
-->
<FrameLayout xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:id="@+id/prayer_native_root"
    android:layout_width="match_parent"
    android:layout_height="match_parent"
    android:layoutDirection="rtl">

    <ImageView
        android:id="@+id/prayer_surface"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
        android:scaleType="fitXY" />

    <LinearLayout
        android:id="@+id/prayer_content"
        android:layout_width="match_parent"
        android:layout_height="match_parent"
        android:orientation="vertical">

        <!-- Row 1: crescent + weekday (start) | location chip (end). Under the
             forced RTL direction «start» is the right edge, exactly like the
             approved design. The city text is width-capped from code, so a
             long city name ellipsises instead of pushing the row past the
             card («از راست و چپ هم بیرون زده»). -->
        <LinearLayout
            android:id="@+id/prayer_header"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:baselineAligned="false"
            android:gravity="center_vertical"
            android:orientation="horizontal">

            <ImageView
                android:id="@+id/prayer_header_icon"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:importantForAccessibility="no" />

            <TextView
                android:id="@+id/prayer_weekday"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:ellipsize="end"
                android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                android:includeFontPadding="false"
                android:maxLines="1" />

            <!-- A plain <View> is NOT in RemoteViews' view whitelist — the
                 launcher rejects the whole layout with "Class not allowed to
                 be inflated android.view.View" (measured on HyperOS,
                 2026-11-04). A zero-content FrameLayout is whitelisted and
                 carries the same weight. -->
            <FrameLayout
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="1dp"
                android:layout_weight="1" />

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_city_chip"
                android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:baselineAligned="false"
                android:gravity="center_vertical"
                android:orientation="horizontal">

                <ImageView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_city_icon"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:importantForAccessibility="no" />

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_city"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:ellipsize="end"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>
        </LinearLayout>

        <!-- Row 2: the live clock, centred. PrayerRemoteLeaves.clock() is
             swapped into this slot with removeAllViews + addView, choosing one
             of the four inflate-time layout variants (12/24 h × fa/latin
             digits). -->
        <FrameLayout
            android:id="@+id/prayer_clock_slot"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content" />

        <!-- Row 3: the one date line. -->
        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/prayer_date"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
            android:gravity="center"
            android:includeFontPadding="false"
            android:maxLines="1" />

        <!-- Row 4: the five capsules. Weight 1 absorbs rounding slack between
             the priced bands. Each box is wrap_content and vertically centred,
             so slack reads as air and the boxes hug their content instead of
             stretching to the row's full height («در حالت بزرگ کردن ویجت …
             باکس‌ها خیلی کشیده می‌شوند»). The row's side padding is set from
             code to cap its width on wide cells. -->
        <LinearLayout
            android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_row"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="0dp"
            android:layout_weight="1"
            android:baselineAligned="false"
            android:gravity="center_vertical"
            android:orientation="horizontal">

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_0"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="2dp"
                android:layout_marginEnd="2dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:gravity="center_horizontal"
                android:orientation="vertical">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_row_0"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:baselineAligned="false"
                    android:gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="horizontal">

                    <ImageView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_check_0"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:visibility="gone" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_0"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                        android:gravity="center"
                        android:includeFontPadding="false"
                        android:maxLines="1" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_time_0"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:fontFeatureSettings="tnum"
                    android:gravity="center"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_1"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="2dp"
                android:layout_marginEnd="2dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:gravity="center_horizontal"
                android:orientation="vertical">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_row_1"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:baselineAligned="false"
                    android:gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="horizontal">

                    <ImageView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_check_1"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:visibility="gone" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_1"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                        android:gravity="center"
                        android:includeFontPadding="false"
                        android:maxLines="1" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_time_1"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:fontFeatureSettings="tnum"
                    android:gravity="center"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_2"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="2dp"
                android:layout_marginEnd="2dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:gravity="center_horizontal"
                android:orientation="vertical">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_row_2"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:baselineAligned="false"
                    android:gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="horizontal">

                    <ImageView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_check_2"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:visibility="gone" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_2"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                        android:gravity="center"
                        android:includeFontPadding="false"
                        android:maxLines="1" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_time_2"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:fontFeatureSettings="tnum"
                    android:gravity="center"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_3"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="2dp"
                android:layout_marginEnd="2dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:gravity="center_horizontal"
                android:orientation="vertical">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_row_3"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:baselineAligned="false"
                    android:gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="horizontal">

                    <ImageView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_check_3"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:visibility="gone" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_3"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                        android:gravity="center"
                        android:includeFontPadding="false"
                        android:maxLines="1" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_time_3"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:fontFeatureSettings="tnum"
                    android:gravity="center"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_4"
                android:layout_width="0dp"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_marginStart="2dp"
                android:layout_marginEnd="2dp"
                android:layout_weight="1"
                android:gravity="center_horizontal"
                android:orientation="vertical">

                <LinearLayout
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_row_4"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:baselineAligned="false"
                    android:gravity="center_vertical"
                    android:orientation="horizontal">

                    <ImageView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_check_4"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                        android:visibility="gone" />

                    <TextView
                        android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_name_4"
                        android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                        android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                        android:ellipsize="end"
                        android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                        android:gravity="center"
                        android:includeFontPadding="false"
                        android:maxLines="1" />
                </LinearLayout>

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_capsule_time_4"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:fontFeatureSettings="tnum"
                    android:gravity="center"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>
        </LinearLayout>

        <!-- Row 5: the progress pill with the countdown inside. The ImageView's
             bitmap owns the pill's HEIGHT (wrap_content) and stretches to the
             card's width (match_parent + fitXY) — no layout-param setter, the
             lesson the tasbih card already paid for. The overlay row centres
             the caption and the remaining time as ONE unit, both at the SAME
             type size (brief: «یک سایز باشند فونتشون ووسط قرار بگیرند»). -->
        <FrameLayout
            android:id="@+id/prayer_countdown_pill"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content">

            <ImageView
                android:id="@+id/prayer_progress"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:importantForAccessibility="no"
                android:scaleType="fitXY" />

            <LinearLayout
                android:id="@+id/prayer_countdown_row"
                android:layout_width="match_parent"
                android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                android:layout_gravity="center_vertical"
                android:baselineAligned="false"
                android:gravity="center"
                android:orientation="horizontal">

                <TextView
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_countdown_prefix"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:ellipsize="end"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />

                <Chronometer
                    android:id="@+id/prayer_countdown"
                    android:layout_width="wrap_content"
                    android:layout_height="wrap_content"
                    android:countDown="true"
                    android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
                    android:fontFeatureSettings="tnum"
                    android:includeFontPadding="false"
                    android:maxLines="1" />
            </LinearLayout>
        </FrameLayout>

        <TextView
            android:id="@+id/prayer_hint"
            android:layout_width="match_parent"
            android:layout_height="wrap_content"
            android:ellipsize="end"
            android:fontFamily="@font/calibri"
            android:gravity="center"
            android:includeFontPadding="false"
            android:maxLines="1"
            android:visibility="gone" />
    </LinearLayout>
</FrameLayout>
